# Lecture 10

### Podcasts in Tutors

---

## Podcast Support

- Spotify player integration
- Standalone podcast cards
- Embedded players in notes and labs
- Episode linking via Spotify ID

---

## Configuration

- Folder name starts with `podcast`
- Episode file contains Spotify ID
- Format: `spotify=<episode-id>`

---

## Summary

Podcasts bring audio content into Tutors, supporting both standalone players and embedded episodes within notes and labs.
